  "bio": "Cameron is renowned for their exceptional skill in creating intricate tattoos with a focus on illustrative, floral, and fine line designs. Known not just in Weaverville but also at American Tattoo San Diego, their work is a testament to their mastery and dedication to the craft, having honed their talent while owning Gold Mountain Tattoo Parlor from 2016 to 2022. Cameron's portfolio is bound to impress even the most discerning of tattoo enthusiasts.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Weaverville, California, United States\n\nowner of @eureka_ink_and_audio  . love doing cover ups and architecture tattoos",
